==Trivia==
[[File:ArticunoexGeneticApex275 artwork.png|thumb|Standalone illustration]]
The special illustration rare card features {{p|Articuno}} flying above the [[Seafoam Islands]], where it can be found in Generations {{gen|I}}, {{gen|III}}, {{gen|IV}}, and {{gen|VII}}. {{p|Horsea}}, {{p|Seadra}}, and {{p|Krabby}}—all of which can be found in the Seafoam Islands and on [[Kanto]] {{rt|20|Kanto}} in several of the games—also appear in the illustration.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Articuno}}.
*'''Ice Wing''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Rocket's Articuno ex|96}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*{{m|Blizzard}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Articuno}} can learn.

